<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Welcome to BENZI - Your Account Details</title>
  <style>
    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; height: auto; line-height: 100%; outline: none; text-decoration: none; }
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F8F9FA; color: #2C3E50; }
    .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4A90E2 0%, #50E3C2 100%); padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; }
    .logo { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: #2C3E50; margin: 0 0 20px 0; }
    .body-text { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2C3E50; margin: 0 0 20px 0; }
    .info-box { background-color: #F0F7FF; border-left: 4px solid #4A90E2; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 6px; }
    .info-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: #1E3A8A; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
    .info-item { font-size: 15px; margin: 5px 0; color: #2C3E50; }
    .info-label { font-weight: 600; color: #4B5563; }
    .cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background-color: #4A90E2; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; }
    .cta-button:hover { background-color: #3A7BC8; }
    .warning-box { background-color: #FFF3CD; border-left: 4px solid #F39C12; padding: 15px 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
    .warning-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #856404; }
    .fallback-link { font-size: 14px; color: #6c757d; margin: 20px 0; }
    .fallback-link a { color: #4A90E2; word-break: break-all; }
    .footer { background-color: #2C3E50; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; }
    .footer-text { font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0; color: #ffffff; }
    .footer-link { color: #50E3C2; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; }
    .footer-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .email-container { width: 100% !important; }
      .content { padding: 30px 20px !important; }
      .greeting { font-size: 20px !important; }
      .body-text { font-size: 15px !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">BENZI</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h1 class="greeting">Welcome to BENZI, {{recipientName}}!</h1>
      
      <p class="body-text">
        You have been invited by <strong>{{therapistName}}</strong> to join the BENZI mental health platform.
      </p>
      
      <p class="body-text">
        An account has been created for you. Here are your temporary login details:
      </p>
      
      <div class="info-box">
        <div class="info-title">Your Login Credentials</div>
        <div class="info-item"><span class="info-label">Email:</span> {{patientEmail}}</div>
        <div class="info-item"><span class="info-label">Temporary Password:</span> <code style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 16px; background-color: #E0E7FF; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">{{temporaryPassword}}</code></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="warning-box">
        <p><strong>🔒 For security reasons, you will be required to change this temporary password immediately during your first login.</strong></p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="cta-button">Log In to Your Account</a>
      </div>
      
      <p class="fallback-link">
        If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}">{{loginUrl}}</a>
      </p>
      
      <p class="body-text">
        If you have any questions or need support getting started, please contact us.
      </p>
      
      <p class="body-text">
        Warm regards,<br>
        <strong>The BENZI Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p class="footer-text"><strong>BENZI</strong> Mental Health Platform</p>
      <p class="footer-text">&copy; {{currentYear}} BENZI. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="footer-text">
        <a href="{{preferencesUrl}}" class="footer-link">Email Preferences</a>
        <a href="mailto:support@benzi.com" class="footer-link">Support</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
